  "description": "Baek Mir, a boy barely scraping by with part-time jobs, appears before him one day, a naked man falling from the sky. He's revealed to be Won-Byul, an alien who crash-landed on Earth. However, after coveting Mir's belongings, Won-Byul, with no place to go, begins calling him \"Sexy\" and approaches him, offering to replenish his energy...!\n\n *\"You're looking for an alien sex worker? Who is that woman?\"*\n\nFrom that moment on, an unpredictable alien sex scene begins!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
